+# Route A safety-eval licensing
+
+The Route A safety evaluation module is evidence-only and is not the selected whole
+FlorisBoard application.
+
+- Kotlin, Gradle and Android resource sources carrying the OpenTypeless Apache header are
+  licensed under Apache-2.0. The fixed upstream root `LICENSE` retains the full text.
+- `RimeAdapter.java` and the three synthetic `src/main/assets/rime/*.yaml` fixtures are
+  OpenTypeless-created integration material selected under MIT. The MIT text is retained at
+  `LICENSES/MIT.txt`.
+- No production dictionary, user text, UserDB, generated native library or real Xiaohè data
+  is included in this source-only patch queue.
